# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated output. Everything below is written by src/build.mjs and
# src/og-build.mjs from event.json, today.json, data/updates/ and src/.
#
# It used to be committed, and that was the reason a push from a home
# connection took twenty minutes and sometimes timed out: every build rewrites
# every share picture and every article page, so each commit added a fresh copy
# of about twenty megabytes of PNGs. The cloud routine deploys by cloning this
# repo and running ./deploy.sh, which regenerates all of it anyway, so none of
# it needs to travel over the wire.
#
# Sources that must stay tracked: src/, index.html, event.json, today.json,
# data/updates/, PROMPT.md, deploy.sh, functions/, _headers, _redirects and
# the root icons.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
assets/og/

# Generated, but small, and Cloudflare Pages now deploys straight from this
# repository — so a file that is not committed is a file that is not on the
# site. These were being uploaded by deploy.sh and stopped reaching the live
# domain the moment publishing moved to Git. robots.txt was answering with the
# HTML fallback page, which tells a crawler nothing.
!sitemap.xml
!sitemap-index.xml
!news-sitemap.xml
!robots.txt
updates.json
/404.html
/about/
/contact/
/sources/
/updates/
/ne/
/nepal-flood/
/nepal-disasters/
